5
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,500
[thunder rumbling]

6
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:29,000
They're coming for you, Barbara!
Look, there comes one of them now!

7
00:02:29,200 --> 00:02:30,200
He'll hear you!
